colors.description:
Color tokens as FLAT key-value pairs (string values only, no nested objects!).
Keys: primary, primaryHover, primaryForeground, secondary, secondaryHover, secondaryForeground, background, foreground, surface, surfaceForeground, border, borderHover, muted, mutedForeground, accent, accentForeground.
Example: { "primary": "#3B82F6", "background": "#ffffff", "foreground": "#1a1a1a", "accent": "#c9a96e" }

navigation.description:
Navigation config. Example:
{
  "items": [
    { "id": "nav-about", "type": "page", "label": { "fr": "À propos" }, "pageId": "page-uuid" },
    { "id": "nav-contact", "type": "page", "label": { "fr": "Contact" }, "pageId": "page-uuid" },
    { "id": "nav-ext", "type": "external", "label": { "fr": "GitHub" }, "url": "https://github.com" }
  ]
}
IMPORTANT: Do NOT add Blog or Boutique/Shop items — they are auto-generated when posts/products exist.

footer.description:
Footer config. Example:
{
  "columns": 3,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "fb-1", "type": "links", "title": { "fr": "Navigation" },
      "links": [
        { "id": "fl-1", "label": { "fr": "À propos" }, "link": { "type": "page", "pageId": "uuid" } },
        { "id": "fl-2", "label": { "fr": "Contact" }, "link": { "type": "page", "pageId": "uuid" } }
      ]
    },
    { "id": "fb-2", "type": "text", "title": { "fr": "Mission" }, "text": { "fr": "Quality craftsmanship." } }
  ],
  "bottomBar": {
    "copyright": { "fr": "© 2026 My Site" },
    "socialLinks": [{ "platform": "instagram", "url": "https://instagram.com/mysite" }]
  }
}
